.DS_Store

# macOS AppleDouble sidecars. This repo lives on an exFAT volume, where macOS writes a `._X`
# beside almost every file. They are not cosmetic: `npm test` runs a bare `node --test`, whose
# discovery picks up `._phase-*.test.mjs` as real test files and FAILS them. Sweep with
#   find . -name "._*" -not -path "./node_modules/*" -delete
._*

# a workspace is a user's data — never in this repo.
#
# `workspace-demo/` is NOT that: it is a checked-in fixture with nobody's real names in it, and it
# is what `npm run demonstrate` falls back to and what `npm run demo` copies into place. It is
# tracked on purpose — a fresh clone that cannot demonstrate itself fails GOAL.md gate 10.
workspace/
.scout/index/
.scout/cache/computed.json

# The storage-root pointer. It is per-machine state, and it is the ONE file that lives outside the
# storage root — so a stray copy in a checkout silently redirects the whole app, and every test
# that sets only SCOUT_DATA reads the wrong folder. That is not theoretical: it turned five tests
# red for an afternoon.
config.md

Claude outputs/

# The polish screenshots (before / after / side by side). They are regenerated by
# design/polish/capture.cjs, they are 23 MB, and they show the reference library's pictures —
# most of which came from elsewhere and are not ours to redistribute if this repo is opened.
design/polish/before/
design/polish/after/
design/polish/compare/

# The CRM showcase's derived cache. Rebuilt on first run; the seed itself is tracked.
workspace-crm/.scout/cache/

